摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Skill studio for DeepSeek Harness: visualize, edit and enable/disable agent skills from the web settings panel and via skillmgr_* tools","id":"gh:1343369289","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-skill-studio","slug":"zhengjy01/dsh-skill-studio","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Skill studio for DeepSeek Harness: visualize, edit and enable/disable agent skills from the web sett"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ings panel and via skillmgr_* tools"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-skill-studio"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> **English** | **中文**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Visualize, edit and manage DeepSeek Harness **skills** right from the web settings panel — list ever"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"y skill DSH discovered, view its full `SKILL.md`, edit the body, and enable/disable model & user inv"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ocation with a switch."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Skill 管理器 settings panel** — 设置 → Skill 管理器: list every skill (name, description, source root, n"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ested flag, model/user invocation state), open any skill to see its full body, edit the `SKILL.md` f"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ile in place, and toggle enable / model-invocable / user-invocable.\n- **skillmgr_list** — list all s"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"kills with source, nested flag and invocation state.\n- **skillmgr_get** — view one skill's full deta"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"il (body + path + policy).\n- **skillmgr_save** — save a full-body edit (frontmatter + markdown) back"},{"id":"p6s6","text":" to the file.\n- **skillmgr_policy** — enable/disable a skill (`enabled` master switch, or per-interf"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"ace `modelInvocable` / `userInvocable`).\n- **Two merged catalogs**: ① direct filesystem scan of the "},{"id":"p6s8","text":"standard roots (project `.dsh/skills` / `.agents/skills`, user `~/.dsh/skills` / `~/.agents/skills`)"},{"id":"p6s9","text":", expanding one level of nested bundles (e.g. `~/.agents/skills/superpowers/<name>` — flagged 嵌套/nes"},{"id":"p6s10","text":"ted), plus ② the official registry (`ctx.skills`) for runtime / bundled skills. The panel therefore "},{"id":"p6s11","text":"shows every skill on disk even when the host-plane filesystem provider is disabled (the web architec"},{"id":"p6s12","text":"ture deliberately moves local discovery to per-agent presets).\n- Enable/disable is implemented with "},{"id":"p6s13","text":"line-level frontmatter surgery on `disable-model-invocation` / `user-invocable`; all other frontmatt"},{"id":"p6s14","text":"er lines are preserved verbatim. Saves are picked up by DSH on rediscovery.\n- Read-only safety: only"},{"id":"p6s15","text":" skills with a real file path (filesystem sources) are editable; runtime / bundled skills are shown "},{"id":"p6s16","text":"as read-only. Routes are loopback-only."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"1. Add the plugin to your profile:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Expected: the command prints the resolved package and records it in that\nprofile's `dsh.profile.bund"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"les` (the host only loads plugins listed there)."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"> **Screenshot slot 1 — install output.** Capture the terminal right after the\n> command, last ~10 l"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ines (resolved package + profile path). Redact your\n> username / home path if it appears. Save as\n> "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"`docs/images/dsh-skill-studio-1-install.png`, then replace this block with\n> `!Install output`."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"2. Restart `dsh web` (or use the sidebar **重启 / Restart** entry if the\n`dsh-restart` plugin is insta"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"tart `dsh web` (or use the sidebar **重启 / Restart** entry if the\n`dsh-restart` plugin is installed)."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Expected: the host boots with `dsh-skill-studio` in its plugin list. There is\nno build step — `lib/`"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"host boots with `dsh-skill-studio` in its plugin list. There is\nno build step — `lib/` is plain ESM."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"3. Open the Web GUI → **设置 (Settings)** → **Skill 工作台**."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Expected: the settings nav shows the \"Skill 工作台\" entry, and the panel lists\nevery discovered skill w"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ith a source badge and its invocation state."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"> **Screenshot slot 2 — panel is live.** Capture the settings nav (entry\n> visible) plus the panel h"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"eader and list. Redact any skill names you consider\n> private. Save as `docs/images/dsh-skill-studio"},{"id":"p16s3","text":". Redact any skill names you consider\n> private. Save as `docs/images/dsh-skill-studio-2-panel.png`."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"1. Click a skill in the list."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Expected: the detail view shows that skill's body plus its source and path."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"2. Edit the body in the textarea, then click **保存 / Save**."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Expected: the panel reports a successful write, and the skill's `SKILL.md` on\ndisk now contains your"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ed: the panel reports a successful write, and the skill's `SKILL.md` on\ndisk now contains your text."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"> **Screenshot slot 3 — editing works.** Capture the detail view with the\n> editor open; use a non-s"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ensitive skill (or blur its content). Save as\n> `docs/images/dsh-skill-studio-3-edit.png`."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"3. Flip the **启用 / 模型可调用 / 用户可调用** switches."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Expected: the row's state changes immediately and stays changed after a\nrefresh (the switch writes `"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"disable-model-invocation` /\n`user-invocable` into the frontmatter)."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"> **Screenshot slot 4 — switches take effect.** Capture the list row with one\n> switch off, then the"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" same row after a page refresh. Save as\n> `docs/images/dsh-skill-studio-4-switches.png`."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"4. Or just tell your agent:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Expected: the agent answers through the `skillmgr_*` tools."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Screenshots to add"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| # | Where | What it shows | How to capture | Suggested filename |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| 1 | Install | The install command's output (package + profile) | Terminal right after step 1, last"},{"id":"p31s2","text":" ~10 lines; redact home path | `docs/images/dsh-skill-studio-1-install.png` |\n| 2 | Install | The pa"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"nel open in Settings with the skill list | Settings → Skill 工作台; include the nav entry | `docs/image"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"s/dsh-skill-studio-2-panel.png` |\n| 3 | Usage | Editing a skill body and saving | Detail view with t"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"he textarea open; use a non-sensitive skill | `docs/images/dsh-skill-studio-3-edit.png` |\n| 4 | Usag"},{"id":"p31s6","text":"e | The three switches after a refresh | Same row before/after refresh | `docs/images/dsh-skill-stud"},{"id":"p31s7","text":"io-4-switches.png` |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"After adding the images, re-run `npm pack --dry-run` and the portability gate\n(`npm run verify`) — t"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"he README is part of the published tarball."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Notes"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"- The frontmatter `name` key must match the skill name (kebab-case); breaking the frontmatter format"},{"id":"p34s2","text":" may cause DSH to skip the skill on rediscovery.\n- Editing is scoped to files the skill registry rep"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"orts; the plugin never accepts arbitrary paths.\n- Zero runtime dependencies beyond the DSH peer pack"},{"id":"p34s4","text":" the plugin never accepts arbitrary paths.\n- Zero runtime dependencies beyond the DSH peer packages."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
